{
 "id": "usb_c_5v",
 "name": "USB-C 5V power input (UFP sink)",
 "description": "USB Type-C receptacle wired as a 5V power sink: CC1/CC2 pulled down with Rd=5.1k (advertises UFP, enables VBUS from any source), VBUS to +5V rail, USB 2.0 D+/D- brought out on both A/B rows. SBU not used. ESD array and polyfuse to be added in rev B (parts pending registry).",
 "circuit_source": "USB Type-C Cable and Connector Specification R2.2, section 4.5.1.2.3 (sink Rd = 5.1k +-10%); connector pin map per PartReel usb_c_16p datasheet reference.",
 "fp_lib": "PCM_PartReel",
